    "body": "## Summary\n\n`MiMoV2ForCausalLM.load_weights` defers fused-qkv FP8 `scale_inv` when the attention TP differs from the checkpoint's interleave TP, then resolves it after loading. `MiMoV2MTP.load_weights` calls the same `load_mimo_v2_qkv_proj_weight` without `deferred_scale_inv`, so in that case loading the MTP layers raises the \"block quantization ceiling\" error. This PR mirrors the main model:\n\n```diff\n MiMoV2MTP.load_weights\n+  deferred_qkv_scale_inv = {}\n   load_mimo_v2_qkv_proj_weight(...,\n+    deferred_scale_inv=deferred_qkv_scale_inv,\n   ...\n+  if deferred_qkv_scale_inv:\n+    _resolve_deferred_qkv_scale_inv(params_dict, deferred_qkv_scale_inv, expected_tp, config=..., model=self)\n```\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** MiMo-V2.6-Flash with EAGLE MTP fails while loading the draft model's qkv `scale_inv`, the same error the main model avoids by deferring it.\n- **After:** the draft model loads, and the server has run MTP in production with the fix applied as a patch.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** MiMo-MTP-only\n\nThe change only affects MiMo-V2 MTP loading, and only when the qkv loader needs to defer the scale. When it doesn't, the dict stays empty and nothing else runs.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40154193373](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40154193373)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40154193412](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40154193412)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40154193368](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40154193368)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
